f054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexMidpoint.lean#L59-L69","doc":"**The L-only flip is `(2/(q² + 1)) · ½(s + s⁻¹)`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexMidpoint.grading_eq_midpoint","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexMidpoint.grading_eq_midpoint","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexMidpoint.lean#L50-L57","doc":"**The grading is a multiple of the symmetric crossing:** `J = (2/[2]) · ½(s + s⁻¹)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexMidpoint.symCrossing_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexMidpoint.symCrossing_eq","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexMidpoint.lean#L42-L48","doc":"`½(s + s⁻¹) = s − h/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexMidpoint.symCrossing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexMidpoint.symCrossing","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexMidpoint.lean#L39-L40","doc":"The symmetric crossing `½(s + s⁻¹)`, with `s⁻¹ = flip q s = s − h`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}